#: ../../source/users/schema/search.rst:5
msgid "Search"
msgstr "搜索"

#: ../../source/users/schema/search.rst:7
msgid ""
"To find information inside a `schema`_ easily, QElectroTech provides a "
"searching feature. This feature allows finding automatically `folios`_, "
"`elements`_, `conductors`_ and `text fields (plain text)`_ which contains a "
"string at one of the properties."
msgstr ""
"要在 `schema <schema_>`_ 中轻松查找信息，QElectroTech 提供了一个搜索功能。 这个功能允许自动查找 `图幅 "
"<folios_>`_，`元件 <elements_>`_，`导体 <conductors_>`_ 和 `文本字段 (普通文本) <text "
"fields (plain text)_>`_，其中包含一个属性的字符串 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/search.rst:11
msgid "To find an object which contains a string:"
msgstr "要找到包含字符串的对象："

#: ../../source/users/schema/search.rst:13
#: ../../source/users/schema/search.rst:41
msgid "Go to `search menu`_."
msgstr "转到 `搜索菜单 <search menu_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/search.rst:18
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech search menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech搜索菜单"

#: ../../source/users/schema/search.rst:20
msgid ""
"Write the string which should be search over the `project`_ in the text box "
"from the menu."
msgstr "在菜单的文本框中写 `项目 <project_>`_ 上搜索的字符串。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/search.rst:21
msgid ""
"Press ``Enter`` and QElectroTech will zoom and display the first object from"
" the list of matches at the `workspace`_."
msgstr "按 ``Enter`` 和 QElectroTech 将在 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 上放大并显示匹配列表中的第一个对象。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/search.rst:22
msgid ""
"Press |icon_next| or |icon_previous| button to zoom the next or previous "
"object from the list of matches."
msgstr "按 |icon_next| 或 |icon_previous| 按钮从匹配列表中缩放下一个或上一个对象。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/search.rst:25
msgid "icon_next"
msgstr "图标"

#: ../../source/users/schema/search.rst:26
msgid "icon_previous"
msgstr "图标( P)"

#: ../../source/users/schema/search.rst:23
msgid "Press |icon_actualize| button to refresh the search."
msgstr "按 |icon_actualize| 按钮刷新搜索。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/search.rst:27
msgid "icon_actualize"
msgstr "图标( A)"

#: ../../source/users/schema/search.rst:31
msgid ""
"If the `search menu`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Edit > "
"Search / Replace** menu item or using ``Ctrl + f`` shortcut keyboard."
msgstr ""
"如果不显示 `搜索菜单 <search menu_>`_，可以从 **编辑 > 搜索/替换** 菜单项或使用 ``Ctrl + f`` 快捷键盘显示。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/search.rst:33
msgid ""
"QElectroTech provides also some advanced properties for searching. Before "
"searching, a filter can be defined to reduce the list of matches according "
"the following criteria:"
msgstr "QElectroTech 还为搜索提供了一些高级属性。在搜索之前，可以定义一个过滤器，以根据以下标准减少匹配列表："

#: ../../source/users/schema/search.rst:36
msgid "`Text fields (Plain text)`_."
msgstr "`Text 字段(原始文本) <Text fields (Plain text)_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/search.rst:37
msgid ""
"Whole words (`Text fields (Plain text)`_, `Conductor properties`_, `Element "
"properties`_, `Folio properties`_)"
msgstr ""
"整词 (`Text 字段 (原始文本) <Text fields (Plain text)_>`_，`制片人属性 <Conductor "
"properties_>`_，`元素属性 <Element properties_>`_，`Folio属性 <Folio "
"properties_>`_)."

#: ../../source/users/schema/search.rst:39
msgid "To create an advanced search:"
msgstr "要创建高级搜索："

#: ../../source/users/schema/search.rst:42
msgid "Press |icon_advanced| button to display the filter tree."
msgstr "按 |icon_advanced| 按钮显示过滤树 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/search.rst:53
msgid "icon_advanced"
msgstr "图标"

#: ../../source/users/schema/search.rst:47
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech advanced search menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech高级搜索菜单"

#: ../../source/users/schema/search.rst:49
msgid ""
"Select the type of text to be searched (**Plain text** or **Whole words**) "
"at the combobox from the right side of the text box."
msgstr "选择要从文本框右侧的组合框中搜索的文本类型 (**Plain text** 或 **整词** 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/search.rst:50
msgid "Click / unclick the button which selects **Case sensitive**."
msgstr "单击/ 不单击选择 **Case 敏感的按钮** 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/search.rst:51
msgid "From here, follow the steps from the standard search."
msgstr "从这里，遵循标准搜索的步骤。"
